# Point the Way: X is Bot1's speed as the ability resolves. Speed 1 on entering; on turn 3 Lightning Bolt makes Bot2 lose life, so
# Bot1's speed increases once, to 2 (CR 702.179c). Sacrificed then for {3}{G}, the ability searches for up to two basic lands:
# Bot1 takes a Forest and an Island, both onto the battlefield tapped, and the Tropical Island stays in the library.

